### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@accessToken = COLLE_TON_ACCESS_TOKEN_ICI

### 1. Mes playlists
GET {{baseUrl}}/playlists/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Créer une playlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/playlists
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "nom": "Ma playlist du matin"
}

### 3. Consulter une playlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/playlists/PLAYLIST_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Ajouter un titre
POST {{baseUrl}}/playlists/PLAYLIST_ID/tracks/TRACK_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Lister les titres, dans l'ordre
GET {{baseUrl}}/playlists/PLAYLIST_ID/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Déplacer un titre en première position
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/playlists/PLAYLIST_ID/tracks/TRACK_ID/position
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "versPosition": 0
}

### 7. Renommer et rendre publique
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/playlists/PLAYLIST_ID
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "nom": "Nouveau nom",
  "visibilite": "PUBLIQUE"
}

### 8. Retirer un titre
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/playlists/PLAYLIST_ID/tracks/TRACK_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Supprimer la playlist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/playlists/PLAYLIST_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}